// Alternative Syntax Demo
// All the different ways to say the same thing

// Using alternative program start
PUT ON THE MAU5HEAD

RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "=== ALTERNATIVE SYNTAX DEMO ==="
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "Multiple ways to do everything"
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""

// Alternative variable declaration
LEMME TELL YOU ABOUT myVar
myVar EQUALS 42

SOME CHORDS TRACK "myVar: "
RAISE YOUR WEAPON myVar

// Alternative comparison (twitter style)
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "--- TWITTER-STYLE COMPARISONS ---"

I REMEMBER followers1
I REMEMBER followers2
followers1 IS NOW 100
followers2 IS NOW 50

WHATS THE FUSS followers1 MORE FOLLOWERS THAN followers2
THE BEAT DROPS
    RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "followers1 has MORE FOLLOWERS THAN followers2"
WHATEVER

WHATS THE FUSS followers2 LESS BEEF THAN followers1
THE BEAT DROPS
    RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "followers2 has LESS BEEF THAN followers1"
WHATEVER

// Alternative loop keywords
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "--- STREAMING-STYLE LOOP ---"

I REMEMBER streamCount
streamCount IS NOW 0

WHILE ONE IS LESS THAN TWO streamCount QUIETER THAN 3
KEEP STREAMING
    PUMP THIS streamCount
    SOME CHORDS TRACK "Stream "
    SOME CHORDS streamCount
    RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK " is live!"
IM BORED

// Alternative break
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "--- LEGAL-STYLE BREAK ---"

STROBE lawsuit FROM 1 TO 10
FLASH
    WHATS THE FUSS lawsuit SAME BPM AS 3
    THE BEAT DROPS
        RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "Ferrari's lawyers have arrived!"
        CEASE AND DESIST
    WHATEVER
    SOME CHORDS TRACK "Iteration "
    RAISE YOUR WEAPON lawsuit
UNFLASH

